<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{ run.report_title | default('데이터 분석 및 모델링 보고서', true) }}</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f5f7fb; --surface: #ffffff; --surface-soft: #f8fafc;
      --ink: #172033; --muted: #64748b; --line: #e2e8f0;
      --primary: #3157d5; --primary-soft: #edf2ff; --accent: #0f9f84;
      --warning: #a16207; --warning-soft: #fef9c3; --danger: #b42318;
      --radius: 18px; --shadow: 0 10px 35px rgba(15, 23, 42, .08);
      --content: 1160px;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { margin: 0; color: var(--ink); background: var(--bg); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Noto Sans KR", sans-serif; line-height: 1.65; }
    a { color: var(--primary); }
    .topbar { height: 7px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary), #6d5ee8, var(--accent)); }
    main { width: min(calc(100% - 32px), var(--content)); margin: 0 auto; padding: 46px 0 72px; }
    .hero { padding: 42px; border-radius: 26px; color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #172554, #3157d5 62%, #0f9f84); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
    .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: .8; }
    h1 { margin: 0; max-width: 820px; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.6rem); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -.045em; }
    .hero p { max-width: 720px; margin: 18px 0 0; color: #dbeafe; }
    .sample-banner { margin: 0 0 20px; padding: 16px 20px; border: 1px solid #facc15; border-radius: 14px; color: #713f12; background: var(--warning-soft); font-weight: 750; }
    .section { margin-top: 28px; padding: 30px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
    .section-head { display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.45rem; letter-spacing: -.025em; }
    h3 { margin: 24px 0 12px; font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .lead { color: var(--muted); margin: 6px 0 0; }
    .badge { display: inline-flex; flex: none; align-items: center; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: .76rem; font-weight: 800; }
    .badge.complete { color: #06715e; background: #dff8f0; }
    .badge.pending { color: #6b7280; background: #eef1f5; }
    .badge.failed { color: var(--danger); background: #fee4e2; }
    .badge.sample { color: #713f12; background: #fef3c7; }
    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 14px; }
    .card { min-width: 0; padding: 18px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; background: var(--surface-soft); }
    .card .label { color: var(--muted); font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 700; }
    .card .value { margin-top: 6px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: -.025em; }
    .pending-panel { padding: 24px; border: 1px dashed #b8c1d1; border-radius: 14px; color: var(--muted); background: var(--surface-soft); text-align: center; }
    .error-panel { padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; color: var(--danger); background: #fff1f0; }
    .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: .9rem; }
    th, td { padding: 11px 13px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); text-align: left; vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap; }
    th { color: #475569; background: #f8fafc; font-size: .76rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .03em; }
    tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
    .number { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .figures { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
    figure { margin: 0; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; background: #fff; }
    figure img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
    figcaption { padding: 14px 16px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .86rem; }
    .feature-list { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 7px; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
    .feature-list li { padding: 5px 9px; border-radius: 8px; color: #344155; background: #edf1f7; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: .78rem; }
    details { margin-top: 24px; padding: 0 18px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; }
    summary { cursor: pointer; padding: 15px 0; font-weight: 800; }
    footer { margin-top: 28px; color: var(--muted); text-align: center; font-size: .82rem; }
    @media (max-width: 850px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } .figures { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    @media (max-width: 560px) { main { width: min(calc(100% - 20px), var(--content)); padding-top: 20px; } .hero, .section { padding: 22px; } .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .section-head { display: block; } .section-head .badge { margin-top: 10px; } }
    @media print { :root { --bg: #fff; --shadow: none; } .topbar { display: none; } main { width: 100%; padding: 0; } .hero { color: #111827; background: #fff; border: 2px solid #111827; } .hero p { color: #475569; } .section { break-inside: avoid; } details { display: block; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="topbar"></div>
  <main>
    {% if is_sample %}<div class="sample-banner">SAMPLE — 화면 확인용 예시이며 모델 및 평가 수치는 실제 결과가 아닙니다.</div>{% endif %}
    <header class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Data &amp; Model Report</p>
      <h1>{{ run.report_title | default('데이터 분석 및 모델링 보고서', true) }}</h1>
      <p>{% if stages.run.status == 'complete' %}{{ run.project_name }} 프로젝트에서 자동 산출된 데이터 처리와 모델 평가 수치입니다.{% else %}파이프라인이 완료되면 실행 결과 수치와 이미지가 자동으로 채워집니다.{% endif %}</p>
    </header>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-head"><div><h2>실행 결과 요약</h2><p class="lead">현재 파이프라인 상태와 자동 계산된 주요 수치입니다.</p></div><span class="badge {{ stages.evaluation.status }}">{{ stages.evaluation.status_label }}</span></div>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card"><div class="label">원본 데이터</div><div class="value">{{ run.dataset.shape.rows | integer if stages.run.status == 'complete' else '준비 중' }}</div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="label">데이터 유지율</div><div class="value">{{ preprocessing.retention_ratio | percent(1) if stages.preprocessing.status == 'complete' else '준비 중' }}</div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="label">모델</div><div class="value">{{ model.model.name if stages.model.status == 'complete' else '준비 중' }}</div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="label">Macro F1</div><div class="value">{{ evaluation.metrics.macro_f1 | percent(1) if stages.evaluation.status == 'complete' else '준비 중' }}</div></div>
      </div>
      {% if stages.run.status == 'complete' and run.get('load_comparison') %}
      <h3>Pandas vs Polars 로딩 비교</h3>
      <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>라이브러리</th><th class="number">로딩 시간</th><th class="number">로딩 결과 크기</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for item in run.load_comparison.results %}<tr><td>{{ item.library }}</td><td class="number">{{ item.seconds | seconds }}</td><td class="number">{{ item.shape.rows | integer }}행 × {{ item.shape.columns | integer }}열</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
      <p class="lead">두 라이브러리의 로딩 결과 shape {{ '일치' if run.load_comparison.shapes_match else '불일치 — 원인 확인 필요' }}</p>
      {% endif %}
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-head"><div><h2>데이터 통계</h2><p class="lead">입력 데이터의 구조, 결측 현황과 클래스 분포입니다.</p></div><span class="badge {{ stages.eda.status }}">{{ stages.eda.status_label }}</span></div>
      {% if stages.eda.status == 'complete' %}
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card"><div class="label">수치형 변수</div><div class="value">{{ eda.numeric_feature_count | integer }}</div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="label">범주형 변수</div><div class="value">{{ eda.categorical_feature_count | integer }}</div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="label">결측 셀</div><div class="value">{{ eda.missing_cell_count | integer }}</div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="label">중복 행</div><div class="value">{{ eda.duplicate_row_count | integer }}</div></div>
      </div>
      <h3>결제수단 구성</h3>
      <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>클래스</th><th class="number">건수</th><th class="number">비율</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for item in eda.class_distribution %}<tr><td>{{ item.label }}</td><td class="number">{{ item.count | integer }}</td><td class="number">{{ item.ratio | percent(2) }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
      <h3>이상치와 상관관계</h3>
      <div class="grid"><div class="card"><div class="label">이상치 수</div><div class="value">{{ eda.outlier_count | integer }}</div></div><div class="card"><div class="label">이상치 규칙 수</div><div class="value">{{ eda.outlier_rules | length }}</div></div><div class="card"><div class="label">상관관계 기준</div><div class="value">|r| ≥ {{ '%.2f' | format(eda.correlation_threshold) }}</div></div></div>
      <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>변수 A</th><th>변수 B</th><th class="number">상관계수</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for item in eda.high_correlation_features %}<tr><td><code>{{ item.feature_a }}</code></td><td><code>{{ item.feature_b }}</code></td><td class="number">{{ '%.4f' | format(item.correlation) }}</td></tr>{% else %}<tr><td>해당 없음</td><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
      <h3>컬럼별 결측</h3>
      <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>컬럼</th><th class="number">결측 수</th><th class="number">결측률</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for item in eda.missing_by_column %}<tr><td><code>{{ item.column }}</code></td><td class="number">{{ item.count | integer }}</td><td class="number">{{ item.ratio | percent(2) }}</td></tr>{% else %}<tr><td>결측 컬럼 없음</td><td class="number">0</td><td class="number">0.00%</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
      {% if eda.figures %}<h3>EDA 시각화</h3><div class="figures">{% for figure in eda.figures %}<figure>{% if figure.exists %}<img src="{{ figure.data_uri }}" alt="{{ figure.alt }}">{% else %}<div class="pending-panel">시각화 파일 없음<br><code>{{ figure.path }}</code></div>{% endif %}<figcaption><strong>{{ figure.title }}</strong></figcaption></figure>{% endfor %}</div>{% endif %}
      {% elif stages.eda.status == 'failed' %}<div class="error-panel">{{ stages.eda.error.message }}</div>
      {% else %}<div class="pending-panel">EDA가 완료되면 데이터 구조, 결측, 클래스 분포와 시각화가 표시됩니다.</div>{% endif %}
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-head"><div><h2>데이터 준비</h2><p class="lead">모델이 학습할 수 있도록 어떤 데이터를 남기고 바꿨는지 보여줍니다.</p></div><span class="badge {{ stages.preprocessing.status }}">{{ stages.preprocessing.status_label }}</span></div>
      {% if stages.preprocessing.status == 'complete' %}
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card"><div class="label">입력 행</div><div class="value">{{ preprocessing.input_shape.rows | integer }}</div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="label">최종 행</div><div class="value">{{ preprocessing.output_shape.rows | integer }}</div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="label">최종 피처</div><div class="value">{{ preprocessing.selected_features | length }}</div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="label">유지율</div><div class="value">{{ preprocessing.retention_ratio | percent(2) }}</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid"><div class="card"><div class="label">제거된 행</div><div class="value">{{ preprocessing.removed_row_count | integer }}</div></div><div class="card"><div class="label">제거된 열</div><div class="value">{{ preprocessing.removed_column_count | integer }}</div></div><div class="card"><div class="label">결측치 처리 변수</div><div class="value">{{ preprocessing.imputed_features | length }}</div></div><div class="card"><div class="label">인코딩 변수</div><div class="value">{{ preprocessing.encoded_features | length }}</div></div></div>
      <h3>선택한 피처</h3><ul class="feature-list">{% for item in preprocessing.selected_features %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
      <details><summary>단계별 필터와 기술 상세</summary>
        <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>단계</th><th>규칙</th><th class="number">제거</th><th class="number">적용 후</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for item in preprocessing.filters %}<tr><td>{{ item.name }}</td><td><code>{{ item.rule }}</code></td><td class="number">{{ item.removed_rows | integer }}</td><td class="number">{{ item.after_rows | integer }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
        <h3>제외 피처</h3><ul class="feature-list">{% for item in preprocessing.excluded_features %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
        <h3>파생 피처</h3><ul class="feature-list">{% for item in preprocessing.derived_features %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
        <h3>변환</h3><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>이름</th><th>컬럼</th><th>파라미터</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for item in preprocessing.transformations %}<tr><td>{{ item.name }}</td><td>{{ item.columns | join(', ') }}</td><td><code>{{ item.parameters }}</code></td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
      </details>
      {% elif stages.preprocessing.status == 'failed' %}<div class="error-panel">{{ stages.preprocessing.error.message }}</div>
      {% else %}<div class="pending-panel">전처리가 완료되면 데이터 유지율, 필터 이력과 선택 피처가 표시됩니다.</div>{% endif %}
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-head"><div><h2>모델 정보 및 평가</h2><p class="lead">학습된 단일 모델의 설정과 자동 계산된 평가 지표입니다.</p></div><span class="badge {{ stages.evaluation.status }}">{{ stages.evaluation.status_label }}</span></div>
      {% if stages.evaluation.status == 'complete' %}
      {% if is_sample %}<div class="sample-banner">아래 모델 및 평가 수치는 화면 확인을 위한 가상 값입니다.</div>{% endif %}
      <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>모델</th><th class="number">Accuracy</th><th class="number">Macro Precision</th><th class="number">Macro Recall</th><th class="number">Macro F1</th><th class="number">Weighted F1</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>{{ evaluation.model_id }}</strong></td><td class="number">{{ evaluation.metrics.accuracy | percent(2) }}</td><td class="number">{{ evaluation.metrics.macro_precision | percent(2) }}</td><td class="number">{{ evaluation.metrics.macro_recall | percent(2) }}</td><td class="number">{{ evaluation.metrics.macro_f1 | percent(2) }}</td><td class="number">{{ evaluation.metrics.weighted_f1 | percent(2) }}</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
      <h3>교차 검증</h3>{% if evaluation.cross_validation %}<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>지표</th><th class="number">Fold</th><th class="number">평균</th><th class="number">표준편차</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>{{ evaluation.cross_validation.metric }}</td><td class="number">{{ evaluation.cross_validation.folds }}</td><td class="number">{{ evaluation.cross_validation.mean | percent(2) }}</td><td class="number">{{ evaluation.cross_validation.std | percent(2) }}</td></tr></tbody></table></div>{% else %}<div class="pending-panel">교차 검증을 수행하지 않았습니다.</div>{% endif %}
      <h3>클래스별 성능</h3><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>결제수단</th><th class="number">Precision</th><th class="number">Recall</th><th class="number">F1</th><th class="number">건수</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for item in evaluation.class_metrics %}<tr><td>{{ item.label }}</td><td class="number">{{ item.precision | percent(2) }}</td><td class="number">{{ item.recall | percent(2) }}</td><td class="number">{{ item.f1 | percent(2) }}</td><td class="number">{{ item.support | integer }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
      <details><summary>학습 설정과 혼동행렬</summary>
        {% if stages.model.status == 'complete' %}<p>분할 전략: {{ model.split.strategy }} · Seed: {{ model.split.random_seed }}</p>{% endif %}
        <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>실제 ＼ 예측</th>{% for label in evaluation.confusion_matrix.labels %}<th class="number">{{ label }}</th>{% endfor %}</tr></thead><tbody>{% for row in evaluation.confusion_matrix['values'] %}<tr><td><strong>{{ evaluation.confusion_matrix.labels[loop.index0] }}</strong></td>{% for value in row %}<td class="number">{{ value | integer }}</td>{% endfor %}</tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
        {% if evaluation.confusion_matrix.figure %}<figure>{% if evaluation.confusion_matrix.figure.exists %}<img src="{{ evaluation.confusion_matrix.figure.data_uri }}" alt="혼동행렬 히트맵">{% else %}<div class="pending-panel">시각화 파일 없음<br><code>{{ evaluation.confusion_matrix.figure.path }}</code></div>{% endif %}<figcaption><strong>혼동행렬 히트맵</strong></figcaption></figure>{% endif %}
      </details>
      {% if evaluation.figures %}<h3>평가 시각화</h3><div class="figures">{% for figure in evaluation.figures %}<figure>{% if figure.exists %}<img src="{{ figure.data_uri }}" alt="{{ figure.alt }}">{% else %}<div class="pending-panel">시각화 파일 없음<br><code>{{ figure.path }}</code></div>{% endif %}<figcaption><strong>{{ figure.title }}</strong></figcaption></figure>{% endfor %}</div>{% endif %}
      {% elif stages.evaluation.status == 'failed' %}<div class="error-panel">{{ stages.evaluation.error.message }}</div>
      {% else %}<div class="pending-panel">모델 학습과 평가가 완료되면 모델 설정, 전체·클래스별 지표와 혼동행렬이 표시됩니다.</div>{% endif %}
    </section>
    <footer>이 문서는 <code>python -m reporting.generate</code>로 자동 생성되었습니다.</footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
